# 036 · "I will install it myself"

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.4.0](../roadmap.md#v040)

## What

Control can show an install recipe in place of running it, then check the machine again. It says whether a recipe restarts anything. A written rule: no installs from background jobs.

## Why

Some owners will not let a remote service install software on their machines.

## Done when

- [ ] The option is on the machine's page, with a test.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

